Third-party components and references
=====================================

1. libxposed API (io.github.libxposed:api:101.0.0 and 102.0.0)
   - License: Apache License 2.0 (https://github.com/libxposed/api)
   - Usage: compileOnly for the backend adapter and testImplementation for JVM stub fixtures.
     No libxposed class is bundled into MeguvizHook artifacts or the sample APK.
   - Its published sources were read to verify interface semantics; no upstream source file is
     copied into this repository and no upstream copyright header was modified.

2. Gradle wrapper files (gradlew, gradlew.bat, gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar,
   gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties)
   - Copied from the Bilibili_Innocent_Lab repository to keep the exact same Gradle 9.8.2
     distribution and SHA-256 pin. Wrapper scripts/jar are part of the Gradle project,
     licensed under Apache License 2.0 (https://github.com/gradle/gradle).

3. JUnit 4.13.2 and androidx.annotation
   - Test/compile-time dependencies only, resolved from Maven Central / Google Maven.

Reference-only material
=======================
Bilibili_Innocent_Lab (BIL) was read read-only to align toolchain versions and to confirm the
libxposed 102 entry metadata layout. No BIL business code, resources or data paths are copied,
and no BIL optimization is claimed as a MeguvizHook result.
